              },
              {
                "name": "version_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Content version identifier"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Removes a content version row and its pages, toc, and theme.\nMainly used to remove pin rows. Real-branch rows can be deleted too —\nthey'll be recreated (empty) on the next sync."
